=== Thread Lifecycle Demonstration ===
Thread created. Is alive? False
Background-Task started
Background-Task working... step 1/5
Thread started. Is alive? True
Background-Task working... step 2/5
Thread running. Is alive? True
Background-Task working... step 3/5
Background-Task working... step 4/5
Background-Task working... step 5/5
Background-Task completed
Thread joined. Is alive? False

=== Thread Timeout Example ===
Timeout-Task started
Timeout-Task working... step 1/10
Waiting for thread to complete (timeout: 3 seconds)...
Timeout-Task working... step 2/10
Timeout-Task working... step 3/10
Thread is still running after timeout
Continuing with other work...
Timeout-Task working... step 4/10
Timeout-Task working... step 5/10
Other work completed
Now waiting for thread to fully complete...
Timeout-Task working... step 6/10
Timeout-Task working... step 7/10
Timeout-Task working... step 8/10
Timeout-Task working... step 9/10
Timeout-Task working... step 10/10
Timeout-Task completed
Thread finally completed

